Content upgrade: run the upgrade hooks of every version step when the upgrade
crosses a major version (the minor bounds applied to every major, so 1.9 -> 2.0
skipped the 2.0 hook and the 1.10 one), and walk into a nested library whose
version already matches the accepted one, so the libraries nested in *its*
params are upgraded too (a chapter column on the current version still held
a text on a version the column no longer accepts).

